<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to December 20.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week</p>
<p>Rank Name			  Price     pct change</p>
<p>1   Fletcher Building	  3.66	     6.40</p>
<p>2   Rothmans		     8.00	     3.90</p>
<p>3   Newcrest Mining	    4.67	     3.78</p>
<p>4   Sons of Gwalia	     6.90	     2.99</p>
<p>5   Fletcher Paper	     2.30	     2.22</p>
<p>6   Pioneer			3.47	     2.06</p>
<p>7   Brierley Investments     1.12	     1.82</p>
<p>8   Qantas			 1.94	     1.57</p>
<p>9   Boral			  3.26	     1.56</p>
<p>10  ICI Australia	     12.79	     1.51</p>
<p>Top 10 largest falls in week</p>
<p>Rank Name			  Price     pct change</p>
<p>1   Goldfields		   2.30	     -12.88</p>
<p>2   Cortecs			3.16	     -12.22</p>
<p>3   PMP Communications	 3.05	     -10.29</p>
<p>4   St George Bank	     7.82		-8.86</p>
<p>5   Village Roadshow	   4.52		-8.69</p>
<p>6   CSL			    5.80		-8.52</p>
<p>7   Village prefs		3.25		-8.45</p>
<p>8   Fletcher Energy	    3.36		-8.20</p>
<p>9   Lihir Gold		   2.28		-8.06</p>
<p>10  Jupiters		     2.76		-8.00</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
